# Live vs helper vs archive

CL app owns catalog **policy**; live files live under `database/`. Resolve via `shared/paths.py`:

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | **Live** working DB (NocoDB underscored headers; refresh via `scripts/cl_db_exporter.py`) |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database (Areeb).csv` | Pre-NocoDB local reference (do not overwrite). Sorter grouping reads this until the live export has the four Areeb columns filled (locked 2026-10-09). |
| `backups/custom-label/` | Pre-change catalog snapshots (`cl_backups_dir()`) |
| `database/custom-label-database/support/` | Size refs, shirts print sizes, mocks, Workbook restore |
| `database/custom-label-database/Apparel Images/` | Apparel image library |
| `database/shared/btc_product_data/BTC_Product_Data.csv` | BTC Product Data (UID join) |
| `database/shared/uneek_product_data/Uneek_Product_Data.xlsx` | Uneek Product Data |
| `database/shared/absolute_product_data/` | Absolute Product Data (CSV if present, else xlsx). Stock Code join, with BTC / Uneek |

Column names: `shared/cl_columns.py` (NocoDB). Stand-ins: `BTC SKU`→`Supplier_SKU`, `Supply Method`→`Stock_Type`.

Useful scripts (app `scripts/`): `fill_from_seeds.py`, `generate_from_mocks.py`, `download_apparel_images.py`, `fill_cl_database.py` (legacy template expand). Fill tools still expect Areeb-era spaced headers until migrated. Warehouse refresh: `scripts/cl_db_exporter.py`.

Run Python from the Custom Label Database app folder. Prefer scripts over opening the full CSV in the editor.
